content.text:
The data points to one fault. The reservation pod went down and stayed down, and frontend's reservation calls fail. Everything else looks like normal load variation.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "reservation",
      "fault_kind": "pod_unavailable",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "metric",
          "sql": "SELECT metric, attr_k8s_pod_name, count(*) c, min(value) mn, max(value) mx FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE metric='k8s.container.ready' AND attr_k8s_pod_name LIKE 'reservation-%' GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "Reservation pod reports k8s.container.ready=0 for every sample across the abnormal window."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT 'ab' p, service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, count(*) c FROM abnormal_traces WHERE span_name ILIKE '%reserv%' GROUP BY ALL UNION ALL SELECT 'n', service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, count(*) FROM normal_traces WHERE span_name ILIKE '%reserv%' GROUP BY ALL ORDER BY 1,2,3",
          "claim": "Reservation service emits no server spans in the abnormal period, while it had 524 CheckAvailability server spans normally."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT 'ab' p, span_name, attr_status_code, count(*) c, round(median(duration)/1e6,2) med_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE span_name='reservation.Reservation/CheckAvailability' AND attr_span_kind='Client' GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "Frontend's CheckAvailability client calls to reservation all end in Error within about 5-50 microseconds, versus successful calls normally."
        },
        {
          "kind": "log",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, level, message, count(*) c FROM abnormal_logs WHERE level='ERROR' GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "Frontend logs 342 'Reservation check availability failed' ERROR messages during the incident window."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "reservation",
      "to": "frontend",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, count(*) c FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='frontend' AND attr_status_code='Error' GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "Frontend server spans fail with Error (724), matching the failed reservation client calls, so user requests fail."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

